   g_clrf: {t: 'CL Rarity/Finish', f: 'rarity · finish (· special) from Card Ladder’s own words only', m: 'Read with the dictionary from Card Ladder’s variation, the part of its card name after a hyphen (Alakazam-Holo), its set name and the labels its cert lookups returned. Card Ladder stores no rarity field, so rarity is none unless a rarity word is written there (Special Illustration Rare, Promo …). Red = PC and CL disagree - including a Special word (1st Edition, Shadowless, a stamp, Ultra Premium Collection, Metal …) that only one side names, since the other side is then the regular printing (Unlimited counts as the regular printing). A ? marks a word the dictionary only thinks it knows.', e: 'none · Holo; Promo? · Reverse Holo · League?.'},
